sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Web or iOS app
    participant S as API server
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant R as Resend
    participant G as Google

    Note over C,R: Register and verify email
    C->>S: POST /auth/register email, password, displayName
    S->>DB: insert user (bcrypt hash, emailVerified false)
    S->>DB: insert authToken type verify, expires in 24h
    S->>R: send verification email
    S-->>C: 201 access token, user
    C->>S: POST /auth/verify token
    S->>DB: mark token used, set emailVerified true
    S-->>C: 200 verified

    Note over C,G: Sign in
    alt Email and password
        C->>S: POST /auth/login email, password
        S->>DB: find user, compare bcrypt hash
    else Google
        C->>G: Google sign in
        G-->>C: ID token
        C->>S: POST /auth/google idToken
        S->>G: verify ID token
        S->>DB: find or create user, link googleId by email
    end
    S->>DB: insert authToken type refresh
    S-->>C: access token + refresh token

    Note over C,DB: Access token expires (15 min)
    C->>S: POST /auth/refresh refreshToken
    S->>DB: check refresh token hash
    S-->>C: new access token

    Note over C,R: Forgot password
    C->>S: POST /auth/forgot-password email
    S->>DB: insert authToken type reset, expires in 1h
    S->>R: send reset email
    S-->>C: 200 check your email
    C->>S: POST /auth/reset-password token, newPassword
    S->>DB: save new hash, mark token used, delete refresh tokens
    S-->>C: 200 sign in again
